# Live: Fillet's value box in the canvas, as in the familiar tool. F, click
# three edges; type 40 over the selected 1 mm (too big for the box): the
# panel explains, and grows so its fields stay readable. Type 4 instead and
# click OK without Enter: typing applies at once, so the fillet is 4 mm.
waitfor tsr.feature.extrude
wait 600
vclick 0.05 0.95
key f
waitfor panelOk
wait 300
wclick 20 0 20                # top front edge
wait 400
wclick 40 15 20               # top right edge
wait 400
wclick 40 0 10                # front right vertical edge
wait 600
type 40
wait 800
shot /tmp/live_fillet_too_big.png
expectheight radius 20
expectheight clearEdges 20
key ctrl+a
type 4
wait 800
shot /tmp/live_fillet_value.png
click panelOk
wait 800
